  "summary": "libnet-easytcp-perl vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that Net::EasyTCP used the built-in Perl rand() function\nto generate encryption keys when no strong randomization module was\npresent. An attacker could possibly use this issue to predict the keys and\nobtain sensitive information.",
